{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51325","headline":"竹〖1〗 · 张南史","name":"竹〖1〗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"竹价长东南，别种殊草木。\n成林处处云，抽笋年年玉。\n天风起成韵，池水涵更绿。\n闲临庾信园，数竿心自足。\n（《古今图书集成·草木典》一九二《竹部》）（〖1〗《文苑英华》卷三二五、《全唐诗》卷二九六收张南史《竹》诗，爲一字至七字诗。\n此作五言诗，而诗句与一字至七字诗大致相同，可断定爲後人据原诗改写而成。\n《佩文斎咏物诗选》卷三三五所收亦同此。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张南史","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51325.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51325","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}